 15→/*
 16→References:
 17→- https://primer.style/components/segmented-control
 18→- https://canvas.workday.com/components/buttons/segmented-control
 19→- https://github.com/adobe/react-spectrum/discussions/7274
 20→- https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Roles/radiogroup_role
